    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@17325",
      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Enter Cloten and two Lords.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 12,
          "className": "charname"
        },
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 21,
          "end": 26,
          "className": "charname"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@17325/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 27,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1066164,
        "end": 1066278,
        "line": 40587,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@17325",
        "anchor": "sceneI_7.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@17443",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FIRST LORD.\nSir, I would advise you to shift a shirt; the violence of action hath made you reek as a sacrifice. Where air comes out, air comes in; there’s none abroad so wholesome as that you vent.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@17443/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@17443/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 197,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1066282,
        "end": 1066511,
        "line": 40590,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@17443",
        "anchor": "sceneI_7.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "FIRST LORD.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@17676",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CLOTEN.\nIf my shirt were bloody, then to shift it. Have I hurt him?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@17676/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@17676/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 67,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1066515,
        "end": 1066612,
        "line": 40597,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@17676",
        "anchor": "sceneI_7.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CLOTEN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@17777",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SECOND LORD.\n[Aside.] No, faith; not so much as his patience.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 14,
          "end": 20
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@17777/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 12,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@17777/line-2",
          "start": 13,
          "end": 61,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1066616,
        "end": 1066714,
        "line": 40602,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@17777",
        "anchor": "sceneI_7.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SECOND LORD.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@17879",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FIRST LORD.\nHurt him! His body’s a passable carcass if he be not hurt. It is a throughfare for steel if it be not hurt.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@17879/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@17879/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 119,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1066718,
        "end": 1066868,
        "line": 40607,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@17879",
        "anchor": "sceneI_7.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "FIRST LORD.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18033",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SECOND LORD.\n[Aside.] His steel was in debt; it went o’ th’ backside the town.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 14,
          "end": 20
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18033/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 12,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18033/line-2",
          "start": 13,
          "end": 78,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1066872,
        "end": 1066988,
        "line": 40613,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@18033",
        "anchor": "sceneI_7.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SECOND LORD.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18153",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CLOTEN.\nThe villain would not stand me.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18153/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18153/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 39,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1066992,
        "end": 1067061,
        "line": 40619,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@18153",
        "anchor": "sceneI_7.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CLOTEN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18226",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SECOND LORD.\n[Aside.] No; but he fled forward still, toward your face.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 14,
          "end": 20
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18226/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 12,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18226/line-2",
          "start": 13,
          "end": 70,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1067065,
        "end": 1067172,
        "line": 40624,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@18226",
        "anchor": "sceneI_7.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SECOND LORD.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18337",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FIRST LORD.\nStand you? You have land enough of your own; but he added to your having, gave you some ground.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18337/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18337/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 107,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1067176,
        "end": 1067314,
        "line": 40629,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@18337",
        "anchor": "sceneI_7.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "FIRST LORD.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18479",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SECOND LORD.\n[Aside.] As many inches as you have oceans.\nPuppies!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 14,
          "end": 20
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18479/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 12,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18479/line-2",
          "start": 13,
          "end": 56,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18479/line-3",
          "start": 57,
          "end": 65,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1067318,
        "end": 1067425,
        "line": 40635,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@18479",
        "anchor": "sceneI_7.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SECOND LORD.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18590",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CLOTEN.\nI would they had not come between us.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18590/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18590/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 45,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1067429,
        "end": 1067504,
        "line": 40641,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@18590",
        "anchor": "sceneI_7.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CLOTEN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18669",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SECOND LORD.\n[Aside.] So would I, till you had measur’d how long a fool you were upon the ground.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 14,
          "end": 20
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18669/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 12,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18669/line-2",
          "start": 13,
          "end": 97,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1067508,
        "end": 1067643,
        "line": 40646,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@18669",
        "anchor": "sceneI_7.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SECOND LORD.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18808",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CLOTEN.\nAnd that she should love this fellow, and refuse me!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18808/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18808/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 60,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1067647,
        "end": 1067737,
        "line": 40652,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@18808",
        "anchor": "sceneI_7.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CLOTEN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18902",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SECOND LORD.\n[Aside.] If it be a sin to make a true election, she is damn’d.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 14,
          "end": 20
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18902/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 12,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@18902/line-2",
          "start": 13,
          "end": 76,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1067741,
        "end": 1067854,
        "line": 40657,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@18902",
        "anchor": "sceneI_7.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SECOND LORD.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@19019",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FIRST LORD.\nSir, as I told you always, her beauty and her brain go not together; she’s a good sign, but I have seen small reflection of her wit.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@19019/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@19019/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 144,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1067858,
        "end": 1068033,
        "line": 40662,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@19019",
        "anchor": "sceneI_7.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "FIRST LORD.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@19198",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SECOND LORD.\n[Aside.] She shines not upon fools, lest the reflection should hurt her.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 14,
          "end": 20
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@19198/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 12,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@19198/line-2",
          "start": 13,
          "end": 85,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1068037,
        "end": 1068159,
        "line": 40668,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@19198",
        "anchor": "sceneI_7.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SECOND LORD.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@19324",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CLOTEN.\nCome, I’ll to my chamber. Would there had been some hurt done!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@19324/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@19324/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 70,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1068163,
        "end": 1068263,
        "line": 40673,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@19324",
        "anchor": "sceneI_7.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CLOTEN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@19428",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SECOND LORD.\n[Aside.] I wish not so; unless it had been the fall of an ass, which is no great hurt.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 14,
          "end": 20
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@19428/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 12,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@19428/line-2",
          "start": 13,
          "end": 99,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1068267,
        "end": 1068404,
        "line": 40678,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap07/p@19428",
        "anchor": "sceneI_7.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SECOND LORD.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@19569",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CLOTEN.\nYou’ll go with us?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "cymbeline/sceneI_7.3/p@19569/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
